      "invariants": [
        "Removed AppSettings fields stay listed in reserved field numbers and names.",
        "Every non-zero/non-empty persisted default is represented in AppSettingsSerializer.defaultValue; historical tag semantics are not custom-migrated.",
        "Standard protobuf unknown fields survive DataStore serializer round trips.",
        "Feature manifests include a proto layer and at least one Rust-consuming layer for each cross-layer setting family."
